==Trivia==
*The word "Nylocas" is very similar to the Hungarian word "Nyolcas", meaning "eight", referencing the eight legs of this arachnid-like creature.
*The latter part of the name of the Nylocas Matomenos likely derives from the Greek term "ματωμένος" ("matoménos"), meaning "bloody" or "bleeding", referencing its background within the lore and its ability to heal The Maiden and Verzik Vitur.
*The Nylocas Matomenos in Maiden's room ''cannot'' be poisoned.  The Nylocas Matomenos in Verzik Vitur's second phase ''can'' be poisoned, dealing 6 damage each time.

